## 7. Directory & Subsystem Tree

```
.
├── XDBF/
│   ├── XDBF.pro                  # Qt build flags, linker libraries (-lQt5Widgets, -lQt5Network)
│   ├── xdbf.cpp / .h             # Core binary container parser & allocator
│   ├── xdbfhelper.cpp / .h       # Low-level byte-swapping pipelines & GUID encoders
│   ├── FileIO.cpp / .h           # Direct binary file stream abstractions
│   ├── mainwindow.cpp / .h       # Primary inspection GUI viewport
│   ├── imagedialog.cpp / .h      # Extraction dialog for raw compressed textures & PNGs
│   ├── achievementviewer.cpp/.h  # Metadata deserializer for achievement bitfields
│   └── *.ui                      # XML forms parsed by uic (Qt User Interface Compiler)
├── assets/                       # Technical schematics and layout assets
├── .gitignore                    # Build artifact isolation filter
└── README.md                     # Engineering specification

```

